				<r3d:description language="eng">With the animal diseases information system (TSIS), the Friedrich-Loeffler-Institute makes up-to-date information on notifiable animal diseases online available to the public. The system allows for an interactive search on animal disease outbreaks in Germany. In addition to the animal health situation on district level, TSIS provides information on all infectious animal diseases in Germany and the respective control measures.</r3d:description>
